{"full":"hf:Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo","spaceId":"Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo","name":"Viggle Turbo for Qwen-Image-2.1","source":"huggingface","description":"6-step Qwen-Image-2.1, T2I + editing, vs-base comparison","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","text-to-image","image-editing","distillation","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":196,"created":"2026-09-22T04:17:35.000Z","updated":"2026-10-01T03:04:50.000Z","license":"other","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://viggle-qwen-image-2-1-viggle-turbo.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:05:53.211Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:05:53.211Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:05:53.211Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"⚡","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A distilled Qwen-Image-2.1 that generates and edits images in 6 steps with no classifier-free guidance, about 5× faster than the 40-step base model. On most prompts it is hard to tell apart from the base model; small, dense text and complicated edits (multi-reference composition, face swaps, identity-preserving edits) can still fall short of it.","v0.3 (2026-09-29): at 6 steps, less grain than v0.2.1 and a little softer on fine texture. We think 6 steps is close to its capacity: every further gain we found cost something elsewhere. The new 9-step setting runs 7 turbo steps and lets the base model finish the last two: finer detail and small text right more often, at about 1.4–1.5× the time of 6 steps. Weights, numbers and ComfyUI workflows are on the model card.","Generate: leave References empty for text-to-image, or add one to six images for editing, composition or style transfer; the prompt refers to them as image 1, image 2, … in the order they were added. Steps runs from 3 to 9, 6 is the default. The Examples rows are pre-rendered by this exact app; clicking one loads its prompt, references, settings and seed. The reference photos woman1/catwindow/bird.webp and the three-reference prompt come from the black-forest-labs/flux-klein-9b-kv Space; the qwen rows come from the Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1 Space."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d7585afa37b8e897bc6a343411dd3a1096078470b0bca4e63d7eb95b9f6c8ee6","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:05:53.237Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:05:53.237Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A distilled Qwen-Image-2.1 that generates and edits images in 6 steps with no classifier-free guidance, about 5× faster than the 40-step base model. On most prompts it is hard to tell apart from the base model; small, dense text and complicated edits (multi-reference composition, face swaps, identity-preserving edits) can still fall short of it.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d7585afa37b8e897bc6a343411dd3a1096078470b0bca4e63d7eb95b9f6c8ee6","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:05:53.237Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T03:04:50.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:05:53.237Z","hash":"d7585afa37b8e897bc6a343411dd3a1096078470b0bca4e63d7eb95b9f6c8ee6","originalBytes":4699,"storedBytes":4699,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["prompt","model","license","qwen","qwen-image-2.1","base","steps","space","app","enhancement","off","only","step","viggle","card","edits","image","images","needed","one","openrouter","prompts","repo","request","research","runs","sent","text","turbo","under","v0.3","zerogpu","about","add","agreement","api","app.py","calls","come","comparison",